OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 38, found with 'homemade
OL,4,Apetrol bomb' charged
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man alleged to have made a "homemade
OL,7,Fpetrol bomb" has been charged with
OL,8,Fmaking an explosive device after
OL,9,Fsuspicious items were found in Aberfan.
OL,11,FSouth Wales Police said the 38-year-old
OL,12,Fman, from Aberfan, Merthyr Tydfil, has
OL,13,Fbeen charged with making an explosive
OL,14,Fsubstance with intent to endanger life
OL,15,For injure property.
OL,17,FThe force said the find was made on the
OL,18,FTaff Trail in the town on 17 October.
OL,20,FThe man appeared before magistrates in
OL,21,FMerthyr Tydfil, accused of making a
OL,22,F"homemade petrol bomb".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
